  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You force a creature to contemplate failure, regret, and its own doubts, breaking their will to resist you.</p><p>Choose a thinking creature within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. It takes <strong>1 Damag</strong>e that ignores <strong>Armor</strong>.</p><p>Additionally, the creature must make a <strong>Willpower</strong> check, or take a <strong>-1</strong> dice penalty to all future <strong>Willpower</strong> checks it makes until the start of your next turn.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration of the penalty to <strong>Willpower</strong> checks by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the <strong>Damage</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p>You may also increase the penalty to <strong>Willpower</strong> by <strong>-1</strong> per extra success.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.qvgAhqaRgsJdVFNk]{Will-Breaker}</p>",
